  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://hysky.de/skyblocker.png\" alt=\"https://hysky.de/skyblocker.png\"></p>\n<p>此模組包包含實用的客戶端<strong>實用工具</strong>與<strong>效能</strong>模組，並搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fskyblocker-liap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyblocker</a> 模組。</p>\n<p>此模組包專為 hypixel.net 的 Skyblock 遊戲模式設計。並非 Hypixel 官方產品。</p>\n<h1>🔧 模組列表</h1>\n<p>此模組包已安裝 24 個模組</p>\n<h3>Hypixel 便利性模組：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fskyblocker-liap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyblocker</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>效能模組：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentityculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Culling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fferrite-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmediatelyfast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ImmediatelyFast</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flithium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lithium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>便利性模組：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftooltip-scroll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tooltip Scroll</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchatpatches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chat Patches</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgamma-utils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gamma Utils (Full-bright)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freeses-sodium-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reese's Sodium Options</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items (REI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Extra</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>其他：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyosbr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YOSBR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fzoomify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zoomify</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>函式庫：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-language-kotlin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyacl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YetAnotherConfigLib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fplaceholder-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Text Placeholder API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmuc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Modpack Update Checker</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎨 推薦資源包</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fhypixel-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hypixel Plus</a><ul>\n<li>需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffirmament\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firmament</a> 以及額外的 JVM 啟動參數！</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffurfsky-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Furfsky Reborn</a><ul>\n<li>需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffirmament\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firmament</a>！</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fskyblock-dark-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyblock Dark UI</a></li>\n</ul>",
